  <data name="SettingsBetaConfirmTitle" xml:space="preserve"><value>Turn on beta testing?</value></data>
  <data name="SettingsBetaConfirmText" xml:space="preserve"><value>Your laptop model has not been verified with this app. Turning this on lets the app change a firmware charge setting that has only been checked on other models. The app saves the original values first, reads every change back and never retries a failed change. If anything looks wrong, use Restore laptop defaults or your laptop's firmware setup.</value></data>
