  <data name="FirstRunTrayText" xml:space="preserve"><value>Battery Care Portal lives in the system tray, next to the clock. If you do not see its battery icon, open the arrow for hidden icons. Click it for the quick pop-up, or right-click it for the menu.</value></data>
