  <data name="FirstRunPpmText" xml:space="preserve"><value>Power Plan Manager is installed and has its battery care on, so it sets the charge limit. Battery Care Portal will not write the limit while it does. You can turn that off in Power Plan Manager if you want this app to take over.</value></data>
